<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse details first half sales, margins.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse details first half sales, margins.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales, of which	3,874	     vs 3,883</p>
<p>  Chemicals division	    880	     vs 955</p>
<p>  Packaging division	  1,492	     vs 1,404</p>
<p>  Aluminium division	  1,108	     vs 1,116</p>
<p> Group operating income	 334	     vs 322</p>
<p>  of which chemicals	    114	     vs 118</p>
<p>  Packaging			 118	     vs 102</p>
<p>  Aluminium			 112	     vs 112</p>
<p> Group operating margin,pct   8.6	     vs 8.3</p>
<p>  of which chemicals	   13.0	     vs 12.4</p>
<p>  Packaging			 7.9	     vs 7.3</p>
<p>  Aluminium			10.1	     vs 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41-1-258 7340</p>
